    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/5cc91a9d156bb2b8bd638d234a0dc915.avif?t=1733137099\" width=630 height=170 /></span><br>Cateia Games proudly presents Country Tales2: New Frontiers, our newest time management strategy game in which you build, explore, gather, produce, trade, clear roads and much, much more, all while enjoying the fun storyline full of interesting characters! <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/26437f8f7778854e3b73f2b35793e2a7.avif?t=1733137099\" width=630 height=170 /></span><br>The town has a new sheriff. But the town also has a new villain. It's up to you to join forces with young sheriff Harriet and her friends to discover colonel Gross's ambitious (read: evil) plans and stop him and his minions before the take over the West!<br><br>Enjoy in beautiful HD graphics and animations; build towns and settlements, upgrade your production and trade, take care of your people and win medals and achievements along the way in this gorgeous colorful time management strategy city builder game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/2835a40f8963d97f75e07fd963cd6420.avif?t=1733137099\" width=630 height=170 /></span><br>This COLLECTOR'S EDITION version contains some special features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Bonus levels<br>- Clear the Road style levels<br>- Free City Build mode<br></li><li> Additional achievements<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/a8d19cb7c8419d4b77edfb81a3cab3e5.poster.avif?t=1733137099\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/a8d19cb7c8419d4b77edfb81a3cab3e5.webm?t=1733137099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/a8d19cb7c8419d4b77edfb81a3cab3e5.mp4?t=1733137099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> JOIN the new sheriff in town, forge new friendships and explore the Wild West<br></li><li> DOZENS of unique levels, bonus levels, medals and collectables to win<br></li><li> BUILD, upgrade, trade, collect, clear the road, explore and much more...<br></li><li> 3 DIFFICULTY MODES: Relaxed, Timed, and Extreme; each one with unique challenges, bonuses, and achievements<br></li><li> USE BOOSTERS on levels to help you reach your goals<br></li><li> STEP BY STEP tutorials for beginners<br></li><li> COLLECTOR'S EDITION includes: 20 bonus levels and additional achievements<br></li><li> GORGEOUS high definition visuals and animations<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/b181bbf716c8d2478427667633974be5.poster.avif?t=1733137099\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/b181bbf716c8d2478427667633974be5.webm?t=1733137099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/b181bbf716c8d2478427667633974be5.mp4?t=1733137099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/5cc91a9d156bb2b8bd638d234a0dc915.avif?t=1733137099\" width=630 height=170 /></span><br>Cateia Games proudly presents Country Tales2: New Frontiers, our newest time management strategy game in which you build, explore, gather, produce, trade, clear roads and much, much more, all while enjoying the fun storyline full of interesting characters! <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/26437f8f7778854e3b73f2b35793e2a7.avif?t=1733137099\" width=630 height=170 /></span><br>The town has a new sheriff. But the town also has a new villain. It's up to you to join forces with young sheriff Harriet and her friends to discover colonel Gross's ambitious (read: evil) plans and stop him and his minions before the take over the West!<br><br>Enjoy in beautiful HD graphics and animations; build towns and settlements, upgrade your production and trade, take care of your people and win medals and achievements along the way in this gorgeous colorful time management strategy city builder game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/2835a40f8963d97f75e07fd963cd6420.avif?t=1733137099\" width=630 height=170 /></span><br>This COLLECTOR'S EDITION version contains some special features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Bonus levels<br>- Clear the Road style levels<br>- Free City Build mode<br></li><li> Additional achievements<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/a8d19cb7c8419d4b77edfb81a3cab3e5.poster.avif?t=1733137099\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/a8d19cb7c8419d4b77edfb81a3cab3e5.webm?t=1733137099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/a8d19cb7c8419d4b77edfb81a3cab3e5.mp4?t=1733137099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> JOIN the new sheriff in town, forge new friendships and explore the Wild West<br></li><li> DOZENS of unique levels, bonus levels, medals and collectables to win<br></li><li> BUILD, upgrade, trade, collect, clear the road, explore and much more...<br></li><li> 3 DIFFICULTY MODES: Relaxed, Timed, and Extreme; each one with unique challenges, bonuses, and achievements<br></li><li> USE BOOSTERS on levels to help you reach your goals<br></li><li> STEP BY STEP tutorials for beginners<br></li><li> COLLECTOR'S EDITION includes: 20 bonus levels and additional achievements<br></li><li> GORGEOUS high definition visuals and animations<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/b181bbf716c8d2478427667633974be5.poster.avif?t=1733137099\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/b181bbf716c8d2478427667633974be5.webm?t=1733137099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983790/extras/b181bbf716c8d2478427667633974be5.mp4?t=1733137099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul></li></ul>",
